batte più veloce.[it][en]When you turn the phone on its side, this block sets 'longPause' to 600 and 'shortPause' to 500: shorter times, so the heart beats faster.[en][es]Cuando giras el celular de lado, este bloque pone 'pausaLarga' en 600 y 'pausaCorta' en 500: tiempos más cortos y el corazón late más rápido.[es]</comment><statement name=\"code\"><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"S/@5k2OGr[hi.42?S~jL\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"NiP6|iBNb^9O1yX=C-!?\">pausaLarga</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_number\" id=\"oSExG/%_HHb~!)HSwZj2\"><field name=\"NUM\">600</field></block></value><next><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"Pw^2QYAXydlpH,_Y[Cjd\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"6_g2#}sz*J:Lk{XU]Qkq\">pausaCorta</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_number\" id=\"F+u*}CF]aqtO$c!Bj%{S\"><field name=\"NUM\">500</field></block></value></block></next></block></statement></block><block type=\"protobject_Inclinación3_change\" id=\"R]B5uFh2af=,4_w3+-ZW\" x=\"338\" y=\"513\"><field name=\"property\">faceUp</field><comment pinned=\"false\" h=\"116\" w=\"400\">[it]Quando appoggi il telefono a faccia in su, questo blocco mette 'pausaLunga' a 1000 e 'pausaBreve' a 700: tempi più lunghi e il cuore batte più lento.[it][en]When you lay the phone face up, this block sets 'longPause' to 1000 and 'shortPause' to 700: longer times, so the heart beats slower.[en][es]Cuando pones el celular boca arriba, este bloque deja 'pausaLarga' en 1000 y 'pausaCorta' en 700: tiempos más largos y el corazón late más lento.[es]</comment><statement name=\"code\"><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"n,@Gq8@f~naQS5Y^a*31\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"NiP6|iBNb^9O1yX=C-!?\">pausaLarga</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_number\" id=\"Lq9R|9#7(_1U?0%$:Dh]\"><field name=\"NUM\">1000</field></block></value><next><block type=\"variables_set\" id=\"cMEL}-}Y-*DMR`1Y?U#Z\"><field name=\"VAR\" id=\"6_g2#}sz*J:Lk{XU]Qkq\">pausaCorta</field><value name=\"VALUE\"><block type=\"math_number\" id=\"L